{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android' data-target='computer\/os\/android' data-title='Android'>\r\n\t\t\tAndroid\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/archive' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/archive' data-title='Archive'>\r\n\t\t\tArchive\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Replace WPA_Supplicant on /system to allow ad-hoc WiFi.","label":"Ad-hoc WiFi","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/android\/archive\/bluestacks","label":"BlueStacks","url":"\/computer\/os\/android\/archive\/bluestacks"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConnection to ad-hoc WiFi is forbidden in Android due to security concerns. The workaround is a patched <code class='inline'>WPA_Supplicant<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: this remounts <code class='inline'>\/system<\/code> read-write and replaces <code class='inline'>\/System\/Bin\/WPA_Supplicant<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Get WPA_Supplicant version<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>WPA_Supplicant -v<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Place patched file on SDCard<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCopy the patched binary onto the SD card.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Stop the WPA_Supplicant service<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTurn off WiFi.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Access RW mode on the system partition<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>mount -o rw,remount -t yaffs2 \/dev\/block\/mtdblock3 \/system<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Delete WPA_Supplicant<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>rm \/System\/Bin\/WPA_Supplicant<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Place patched file<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cat '\/SDCard\/WPA_Supplicant vX.X.X' &gt; \/System\/Bin\/WPA_Supplicant<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Fix file flags<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chmod 755 \/System\/Bin\/WPA_Supplicant<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/android\/archive\/adhoc_wifi\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/android\/archive\/adhoc_wifi\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/archive\/bluestacks' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/archive\/bluestacks' data-title='BlueStacks' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>BlueStacks<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/android\/archive' data-target='computer\/os\/android\/archive' data-title='Archive'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Archive<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}